//! PCIe on the Alinx AX7A200B: what goes behind the endpoint's BAR.
//!
//! The endpoint is AMD's DMA/Bridge Subsystem for PCI Express (XDMA)
//! in its AXI bridge mode, generated by the build; see `BUILD.bazel`.
//! A read or a write of BAR1 by the host comes out of it as a burst on
//! an AXI4 master, at its pins. [`bar::PcieBar`] is the lowered design
//! that answers them: the pins joined to the link's channels, a
//! peripheral tracker, and [`bar::BarRegs`], four words a host can
//! read and write.
pub mod bar;
